  "description": "Greater than the average bike, Intrigue E+ Pro is powered up and ready to hit all the exciting terrain of its battery-free sisters. Get ready to boost with a SyncDrive Pro motor, RideControl ONE’s clean controls and optional display upgrade. All this atop the playful and aggressive Liv 3F frame design, complete with a 150 mm fork and 140 mm of rear Maestro suspension. Intrigue E+ Pro’s ample stand-over height and fully-integrated EnergyPak Smart battery let you maneuver through technical sections with ease and confidence. Tubeless-ready Boost 27.5-inch wheels with plus size tire compatibility, combined with the torsionally stiff yet sleek and lightweight one-piece carbon linkage that begs for high-speed descents and technical climbs, makes Intrigue E+ Pro one determined riding machine.",
